@host = http://localhost:8080
@jobId = replace-after-submit

### Discover workflows
GET {{host}}/api/v1/workflows

### Submit a successful export
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: local-export-001

{
  "workflowType": "data-export",
  "input": {
    "dataset": "customers",
    "format": "parquet",
    "recordCount": 24000
  }
}

### Submit a job that fails once and recovers
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: local-resilience-demo-001

{
  "workflowType": "document-processing",
  "input": {
    "documentName": "quarterly-report.pdf",
    "simulateFailureAtStep": 2,
    "failForAttempts": 1
  }
}

### Get a job
GET {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}

### Get timeline
GET {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/events

### Retry a failed job
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/retry

### Cancel queued or running work
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/cancel
